<h1>Install pH7Builder</h1>
<p><strong>Important:</strong> This legacy installation guide has been superseded. Do not follow historic instructions that suggest world-writable (777) directories or an unverified release archive.</p>
<p>Current pH7Builder releases use a protected, guided browser installer after the server requirements have been checked. Install only a published release package and follow the matching guidance.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/pH7Software/pH7-Social-Dating-CMS/blob/18.x/docs/QUICK_START.md">Current installation instructions, file permissions and HTTPS setup</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/pH7Software/pH7-Social-Dating-CMS/releases">Download a published release</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/pH7Software/pH7-Social-Dating-CMS/blob/18.x/docs/LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md">Check your installation before accepting members or payments</a></li>
</ul>
<p>For local evaluation, use the Docker instructions in the current repository README. Do not use development Docker credentials in production.</p>
